================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

`PraesciaDICOM` links GDCM (Grassroots DICOM) through the `GDCMShim` target.
GDCM is built by `Tooling/build-gdcm.sh` into `Vendor/GDCM.xcframework`, which
is not committed to this repository — but it *is* linked into any binary that
depends on `PraesciaDICOM`, so the attribution below travels with that binary.

GDCM vendors its dependencies rather than requiring system libraries, so the
components listed here are those actually merged into the static library. The
list was taken from the built tree, not from GDCM's documentation. Components
present in GDCM's source but deliberately excluded from the merge — `socketxx`
and `gdcmMEXD` (the DIMSE network layer), and the `pvrg` and `getopt` helpers
used only by GDCM's command-line applications, which are not built — are not
listed, because they are not in the binary.

